class="pill">React</span><span class="pill">Validated data</span></div><section class="preview-shell" aria-label="FileReview preview"><div class="mcpcn-stack"><label class="mcpcn-label">Preview theme<select aria-label="Preview theme"><option value="light" selected="">Light</option><option value="dark">Dark</option></select></label><div data-preview-theme="light"><div class="mcpcn-stack"><label class="mcpcn-label">Consumer response<select aria-label="Consumer response"><option value="immediate" selected="">Immediate</option><option value="delayed">Delayed</option><option value="reject">Reject</option></select></label><section class="mcpcn mcpcn-card mcpcn-file-root" role="region" aria-label="Review supplied file values" aria-busy="false"><header class="mcpcn-header"><h3 class="mcpcn-title">Review supplied file values</h3></header><div class="mcpcn-body mcpcn-stack"><dl class="mcpcn-file-details" aria-label="Reported file details"><div><dt>File name</dt><dd>Authored invoice.txt</dd></div><div><dt>File ID</dt><dd>authored-file-1</dd></div><div><dt>Revision</dt><dd>1</dd></div><div><dt>Reported bytes</dt><dd>62</dd></div><div><dt>MIME hint</dt><dd>text/plain</dd></div></dl><section class="mcpcn mcpcn-card mcpcn-file-root" role="region" aria-label="Inspect the supplied document" aria-busy="false"><header class="mcpcn-header"><h3 class="mcpcn-title">Inspect the supplied document</h3></header><div class="mcpcn-body mcpcn-stack"><dl class="mcpcn-file-details" aria-label="Reported file details"><div><dt>File name</dt><dd>Authored invoice.txt</dd></div><div><dt>File ID</dt><dd>authored-file-1</dd></div><div><dt>Revision</dt><dd>1</dd></div><div><dt>Reported bytes</dt><dd>62</dd></div><div><dt>MIME hint</dt><dd>text/plain</dd></div></dl><p class="mcpcn-hint">This supplied representation does not verify the original file.</p><nav class="mcpcn-row" aria-label="Document page navigation"><button class="mcpcn mcpcn-button" type="button" data-variant="secondary" disabled="">Previous page</button><label class="mcpcn-label">Document page<select class="mcpcn mcpcn-input" aria-label="Document page"><option value="page-1" selected="">Invoice</option><option value="page-2">Review note</option></select></label><button class="mcpcn mcpcn-button" type="button" data-variant="secondary">Next page</button><output role="status" aria-live="polite">Page <!-- -->1<!-- --> of <!-- -->2</output></nav><div id="_R_9imav5ubtb_" class="mcpcn-file-viewport" role="region" aria-label="Document content" tabindex="0"><article aria-label="Invoice"><h4>Invoice</h4><pre class="mcpcn-file-text">Authored invoice
Supplier: Acme Labs
Total: EUR 48.20
Page one ends here.</pre></article></div><section aria-label="Document sources"><h4>Sources</h4><ol class="mcpcn-stack"><li><button class="mcpcn mcpcn-button" type="button" data-variant="secondary" aria-label="Select source: Supplier source" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="_R_9imav5ubtb_">Supplier source</button><p class="mcpcn-hint">Page: <!-- -->Invoice</p><blockquote class="mcpcn-file-text">Supplier: Acme Labs</blockquote></li><li><button class="mcpcn mcpcn-button" type="button" data-variant="secondary" aria-label="Select source: Payment terms source" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="_R_9imav5ubtb_">Payment terms source</button><p class="mcpcn-hint">Page: <!-- -->Review note</p><blockquote class="mcpcn-file-text">Payment terms: 30 days</blockquote></li></ol></section></div></section><section class="mcpcn mcpcn-card" aria-busy="false"><form aria-label="Review extracted fields"><header class="mcpcn-header"><h3 class="mcpcn-title">Review extracted fields</h3></header><div class="mcpcn-body mcpcn-stack"><section class="mcpcn-stack" aria-label="Supplier"><label class="mcpcn-label" for="_R_1dimav5ubtb_-0">Supplier<!-- --> (required)</label><p class="mcpcn-description">Extracted: <!-- -->Acme Labs</p><span class="mcpcn mcpcn-badge">97<!-- -->% confidence</span><input class="mcpcn mcpcn-input" id="_R_1dimav5ubtb_-0" aria-label="Correct Supplier" required="" maxLength="4000" value="Acme Labs"/><ul class="mcpcn-stack" aria-label="Supporting evidence"><li><strong>Authored supplier line</strong><p class="mcpcn-description">Supplier: Acme Labs</p></li></ul></section><section class="mcpcn-stack" aria-label="Total"><label class="mcpcn-label" for="_R_1dimav5ubtb_-1">Total<!-- --> (required)</label><p class="mcpcn-description">Extracted: <!-- -->EUR 48.20</p><span class="mcpcn mcpcn-badge">91<!-- -->% confidence</span><input class="mcpcn mcpcn-input" id="_R_1dimav5ubtb_-1" aria-label="Correct Total" required="" maxLength="4000" value="EUR 48.20"/><ul class="mcpcn-stack" aria-label="Supporting evidence"><li><strong>Authored total line</strong><p class="mcpcn-description">Total: EUR 48.20</p></li></ul></section></div><footer class="mcpcn-footer"><button class="mcpcn mcpcn-button" type="submit">Review current corrections</button></footer></form></section><section class="mcpcn-file-save mcpcn-stack" aria-label="Save reviewed file values" aria-busy="false"><p role="status">Review current corrections before confirming these file values.</p><button class="mcpcn mcpcn-button" type="button" disabled="">Save reviewed fields</button></section></div></section><div class="filter-row"><button type="button" class="button secondary">Append unrelated page</button><button type="button" class="button secondary">Replace file revision</button><button type="button" class="button secondary">Replace extraction revision</button></div><p class="mcpcn-hint">Authored representations and local consumer feedback only. The component does not read files, extract data or save records. Matching IDs do not verify original bytes.</p><p>File review intents: <output aria-label="File review intent count">0</output> · Settled: <output aria-label="Settled callback count">0</output></p><pre class="code" aria-label="Last file review intent">null</pre></div></div></div></section><section class="section prose"><h2>Install</h2><pre class="code">pnpm dlx mcpcn add <!-- -->file-review</pre><p>Public npm availability is a separate release gate. The repository documentation records the currently verified source, archives and hosting profile.</p><h2>Data props</h2><p>These fields come from the actual exported schema. Defaults may be omitted on input; the schema below describes validated output. Runtime checks also validate identities, conditional values and safe evidence links.</p><div class="mcpcn-table-wrap"><table class="mcpcn-table"><caption>FileReview<!-- --> data fields</caption><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Input</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><code>id</code></th><td>string</td><td>Required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>title</code></th><td>string</td><td>Required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>description</code></th><td>string</td><td>Optional</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>file</code></th><td>union</td><td>Required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>preview</code></th><td>union</td><td>Optional</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>extraction</code></th><td>object</td><td>Optional</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>disabled</code></th><td>boolean</td><td>Defaulted</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>confirmLabel</code></th><td>string</td><td>Defaulted</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>confirmationLabel</code></th><td>string</td><td>Defaulted</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2>React integration</h2><pre class="code">&quot;use client&quot;;
import { useState } from &quot;react&quot;;
import { FileReview, type ComponentAction } from &quot;@mcpcn/react&quot;;
import type { FileReviewData } from &quot;@mcpcn/schemas&quot;;

export function Example() {
  const [data, setData] = useState&lt;FileReviewData&gt;({
  &quot;id&quot;: &quot;authored-review-1&quot;,
  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Review supplied file values&quot;,
  &quot;file&quot;: {
    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;authored-file-1&quot;,
    &quot;revision&quot;: &quot;1&quot;,
    &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Authored invoice.txt&quot;,
    &quot;bytes&quot;: 62,
    &quot;mimeType&quot;: &quot;text/plain&quot;
  },
  &quot;preview&quot;: {
    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;authored-preview-1&quot;,
    &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Inspect the authored document&quot;,
    &quot;file&quot;: {
      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;authored-file-1&quot;,
      &quot;revision&quot;: &quot;1&quot;,
      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Authored invoice.txt&quot;,
      &quot;bytes&quot;: 62,
      &quot;mimeType&quot;: &quot;text/plain&quot;
    },
    &quot;state&quot;: &quot;ready&quot;,
    &quot;content&quot;: {
      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;pages&quot;,
      &quot;pages&quot;: [
        {
          &quot;id&quot;: &quot;page-1&quot;,
          &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Invoice&quot;,
          &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Authored invoice\nSupplier: Acme Labs\nTotal: EUR 48.20\nPage one ends here.&quot;
        },
        {
          &quot;id&quot;: &quot;page-2&quot;,
          &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Review note&quot;,
          &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Authored appendix\nPayment terms: 30 days\nFinal authored line.&quot;
        }
      ]
    },
    &quot;sources&quot;: [
      {
        &quot;id&quot;: &quot;supplier-source&quot;,
        &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Supplier source&quot;,
        &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Supplier: Acme Labs&quot;,
        &quot;pageId&quot;: &quot;page-1&quot;
      },
      {
        &quot;id&quot;: &quot;terms-source&quot;,
        &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Payment terms source&quot;,
        &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Payment terms: 30 days&quot;,
        &quot;pageId&quot;: &quot;page-2&quot;
      }
    ]
  },
  &quot;extraction&quot;: {
    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;authored-extraction-1&quot;,
    &quot;revision&quot;: &quot;1&quot;,
    &quot;fileId&quot;: &quot;authored-file-1&quot;,
    &quot;fileRevision&quot;: &quot;1&quot;,
    &quot;fields&quot;: [
      {
        &quot;id&quot;: &quot;supplier&quot;,
        &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Supplier&quot;,
        &quot;original&quot;: &quot;Acme Labs&quot;,
        &quot;value&quot;: &quot;Acme Labs&quot;,
        &quot;required&quot;: true,
        &quot;confidence&quot;: 0.97,
        &quot;evidence&quot;: [
          {
            &quot;id&quot;: &quot;supplier-line&quot;,
            &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Authored supplier line&quot;,
            &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Supplier: Acme Labs&quot;
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        &quot;id&quot;: &quot;total&quot;,
        &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Total&quot;,
        &quot;original&quot;: &quot;EUR 48.20&quot;,
        &quot;value&quot;: &quot;EUR 48.20&quot;,
        &quot;required&quot;: true,
        &quot;confidence&quot;: 0.91,
        &quot;evidence&quot;: [
          {
            &quot;id&quot;: &quot;total-line&quot;,
            &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Authored total line&quot;,
            &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Total: EUR 48.20&quot;
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
});
  const [last, setLast] = useState&lt;ComponentAction | null&gt;(null);
  const handleAction = (action: ComponentAction) =&gt; {
    setLast(action);
    const scope = action.data as { reviewId?: string; fileId?: string; fileRevision?: string; extractionId?: string; extractionRevision?: string; fieldId?: string; value?: string } | undefined;
    if (action.type === &quot;file-correction-change&quot; &amp;&amp; scope?.reviewId === data.id &amp;&amp; data.file &amp;&amp; data.extraction &amp;&amp; scope.fileId === data.file.id &amp;&amp; scope.fileRevision === data.file.revision &amp;&amp; scope.extractionId === data.extraction.id &amp;&amp; scope.extractionRevision === data.extraction.revision) {
      setData(current =&gt; {
        if (!current.file || !current.extraction || scope.reviewId !== current.id || scope.fileId !== current.file.id || scope.fileRevision !== current.file.revision || scope.extractionId !== current.extraction.id || scope.extractionRevision !== current.extraction.revision) return current;
        return { ...current, extraction: { ...current.extraction, fields: current.extraction.fields.map(field =&gt; field.id === scope.fieldId &amp;&amp; !field.disabled &amp;&amp; typeof scope.value === &quot;string&quot; ? { ...field, value: scope.value } : field) } };
      });
    }
    // save-file-review is intent only. Independently validate scope, values,
    // authorization and persistence in your application before claiming success.
  };
  return &lt;&gt;
    &lt;FileReview {...data} onAction={handleAction} /&gt;
    &lt;pre aria-label=&quot;Last file review intent&quot;&gt;{JSON.stringify(last, null, 2)}&lt;/pre&gt;
  &lt;/&gt;;
}</pre><h2>Supplied representations</h2><p>Inspect complete text, bounded JSON or up to twenty ordered pages containing text, PNG, JPEG or WebP data. The consumer owns reading, conversion, extraction and persistence. Supplied pages and reported confidence do not verify original file bytes or extraction accuracy.</p><p>Only the selected raster page is mounted. Native page/source controls and fit/zoom support inspection; HTML, SVG, arbitrary image URLs and PDF embeds are not rendered. Header validation is bounded; a browser decode error remains visible beside supplied text.</p><p>The native DTO budget is 2 MiB of UTF-8 JSON: text is at most 65536 UTF-16 units per page, each image at most 256 KiB decoded, images collectively at most 1 MiB, dimensions at most 4096 per side and 8 million pixels. JSON retains its existing descriptor-safe bounds. The playground editor has a smaller limit: 8192 units per string and 65536 UTF-8 bytes per result.</p><p>File identity, revision and extraction identity must match the displayed ready preview before review and save intent become available. Corrections are caller-controlled. Review the current corrections, check the explicit confirmation, then request saving. Replacements or changed values invalidate confirmation. A rejected callback preserves current corrections; callback settlement does not mean a record was saved.</p><p>View intents carry identity only. Corrections and save intents deliberately contain reviewed private values. PrivateOnly catalogue metadata does not redact content already passed to a model. Keep private documents in app-only state and publish model context explicitly.</p><p><code>className</code> styles the surface and <code>onAction</code> receives consumer-owned intent. The new domain controls and revised approval/form surfaces expose <code>busy</code> and <code>error</code> feedback. Controlled selections and answers must be acknowledged by updating their props.</p><h2>Events</h2><div class="mcpcn-table-wrap"><table class="mcpcn-table"><caption>FileReview<!-- --> action payloads</caption><thead><tr><th>Action type</th><th>Data</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><code>file-correction-change</code></th><td><code>{ reviewId, fileId, fileRevision, extractionId, extractionRevision, fieldId, value }</code></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>save-file-review</code></th><td><code>{ reviewId, fileId, fileRevision, extractionId, extractionRevision, values: current declared corrections }</code></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>document-page-change / document-source-change</code></th><td><code>Preview-scoped view identity only</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2>JSON Schema</h2><pre class="code" aria-label="FileReview JSON Schema">{
