}</pre><h2>Structured tool result</h2><pre class="code">import { FileReviewSchema } from &quot;@mcpcn/schemas&quot;;
import { createStructuredResult } from &quot;@mcpcn/server&quot;;

export function reviewedResult(candidate: unknown) {
  const data = FileReviewSchema.parse(candidate);
  return createStructuredResult(&quot;file-review&quot;, data);
}</pre><h2>Security contract</h2><p>Previews use authored data and consumer callbacks. Applications own authorization, persistence, tool execution and explicit model-context publication.</p><p><strong>Declared model-visible fields:</strong> <!-- -->id, file.id, file.revision, extraction.id, extraction.revision, extraction.fileId, extraction.fileRevision</p><p><strong>Private fields:</strong> <!-- -->title, description, file.name, file.mimeType, preview, extraction.fields, extraction.fields.original, extraction.fields.value, extraction.fields.evidence, drafts, values</p><p><strong>Declared consumer tool intents:</strong> <!-- -->None</p><p><strong>Destructive intent:</strong> <!-- -->No by default</p><h2>Host and keyboard behavior</h2><p>Host integration uses the consuming application&#x27;s runtime provider. Native inputs, buttons, links and semantic tables expose the local interactions shown above. External-host compatibility and full accessibility conformance require their own acceptance evidence.</p></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer><div><strong>MCPCN</strong><p>Human control for agentic apps.</p></div><div><a href="/llms.txt">llms.txt</a><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui">GitHub</a><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/blob/main/SECURITY.md">Security</a></div></footer><script src="/_next/static/chunks/3yh5jaalv1u8v.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[14058,[\"/_next/static/chunks/332uslzbhf388.js\"],\"\"]\n3:I[43820,[\"/_next/static/chunks/332uslzbhf388.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[98737,[\"/_next/static/chunks/332uslzbhf388.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[69110,[\"/_next/static/chunks/332uslzbhf388.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n7:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\na:I[69110,[\"/_next/static/chunks/332uslzbhf388.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\nc:I[69110,[\"/_next/static/chunks/332uslzbhf388.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\ne:I[98025,[\"/_next/s