s visible beside supplied text.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The native DTO budget is 2 MiB of UTF-8 JSON: text is at most 65536 UTF-16 units per page, each image at most 256 KiB decoded, images collectively at most 1 MiB, dimensions at most 4096 per side and 8 million pixels. JSON retains its existing descriptor-safe bounds. The playground editor has a smaller limit: 8192 units per string and 65536 UTF-8 bytes per result.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"File identity, revision and extraction identity must match the displayed ready preview before review and save intent become available. Corrections are caller-controlled. Review the current corrections, check the explicit confirmation, then request saving. Replacements or changed values invalidate confirmation. A rejected callback preserves current corrections; callback settlement does not mean a record was saved.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"View intents carry identity only. Corrections and save intents deliberately contain reviewed private values. PrivateOnly catalogue metadata does not redact content already passed to a model. Keep private documents in app-only state and publish model context explicitly.\"}]]\n13:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"className\"}],\" styles the surface and \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"onAction\"}],\" receives consumer-owned intent. The new domain controls and revised approval/form surfaces expose \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"busy\"}],\" and \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"error\"}],\" feedback. Controlled selections and answers must be acknowledged by updating their props.\"]}]\n14:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"Events\"}]\n15:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mcpcn-table-wrap\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"mcpcn-table\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"caption\",null,{\"children\":[\"FileReview\",\" action payloads\"]}],[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{